+- **Unit Tests:** 22/22 unit tests passing in Node test runner (`npx tsx --test src/utils/*.test.ts`) in 563ms.
+- **TypeScript & Linting:** 0 errors reported by `tsc --noEmit` and Vite build.
+- **REST Endpoints Verified:**
